{"about_the_game":"In <strong>Midnight Door</strong>, Lidia, a typical, bored, small-town American teenager, accidentally befriends a friendly but powerful creature with the ability to open &quot;doors&quot; to other dimensions!  Lidia and her new friend, Buddy, soon draw unwanted attention from powerful interdimensional adversaries.  They must embark on an adventure spanning numerous worlds to protect themselves and Lidia's home town.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/7f82abf3f103d6ce09e53e0ced6482cd.poster.avif?t=1753709538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/7f82abf3f103d6ce09e53e0ced6482cd.webm?t=1753709538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/7f82abf3f103d6ce09e53e0ced6482cd.mp4?t=1753709538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To overcome the various beasts, brawlers, and monstrosities that confront the duo, you'll have to master Lidia's combat and evasion abilities as well as Buddy's magic and environment manipulation.  Players can customize their approach to combat by equipping Lidia with a variety of weapons and using Buddy's psychic link to empower Lidia through various synergies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/0b60f552bedd3697b31e578c7551d963.poster.avif?t=1753709538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/0b60f552bedd3697b31e578c7551d963.webm?t=1753709538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/0b60f552bedd3697b31e578c7551d963.mp4?t=1753709538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore diverse environments to find secret paths, unravel obscure mysteries, and learn about the strange creatures that inhabit the bizarre dimensions Parallel to our own.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2421010?t=1753709538","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753709538","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753709538","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753709538","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"In <strong>Midnight Door</strong>, Lidia, a typical, bored, small-town American teenager, accidentally befriends a friendly but powerful creature with the ability to open &quot;doors&quot; to other dimensions!  Lidia and her new friend, Buddy, soon draw unwanted attention from powerful interdimensional adversaries.  They must embark on an adventure spanning numerous worlds to protect themselves and Lidia's home town.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/7f82abf3f103d6ce09e53e0ced6482cd.poster.avif?t=1753709538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/7f82abf3f103d6ce09e53e0ced6482cd.webm?t=1753709538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421010/extras/7f82abf3f103d6ce09e53e0c